WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.124
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:03.624 --> 00:00:05.490
ALICIA WILLIAMS: In
this video, we're

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:08.010
going to walk through how
to manage user permissions

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:10.950
for the payments profile tied
to your Google Cloud billing

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.160
account.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.040
If you're looking to
give users permission

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:17.010
to update your payment method,
billing address, or payment

00:00:17.010 --> 00:00:18.870
contacts, you'll
need to grant them

00:00:18.870 --> 00:00:21.480
permissions on the
payments profile associated

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:23.070
with your billing account.

00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:25.110
Your billing account
and payments profile

00:00:25.110 --> 00:00:27.810
are separate entities
that work together.

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:29.550
The billing account
tracks the costs

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:31.440
incurred by all
attached projects

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:34.050
and defines who pays
for the resources.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:36.570
It is connected to a
payments profile, which

00:00:36.570 --> 00:00:38.670
stores your payment
instrument information

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:41.220
and defines how you
pay for charges.

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:44.460
A payments profile can be linked
to multiple payment accounts

00:00:44.460 --> 00:00:47.850
across Google products, such as
Google Workspace, Google Cloud,

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:49.590
Google Ads, and more.

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:51.240
Let's walk through
what permissions

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:54.940
are available for the payments
profile and how to update them.

00:00:54.940 --> 00:00:57.690
Get started by heading
into the Cloud Console.

00:00:57.690 --> 00:01:00.510
You can start on your
organization or any project

00:01:00.510 --> 00:01:02.760
homepage, then head
to the navigation

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:04.590
menu in the left-hand pane.

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:08.670
Choose Billing, and then
click Manage Billing Accounts.

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:11.340
If you land in a Billing
Overview page, which

00:01:11.340 --> 00:01:14.430
looks like this, you can
navigate to Manage Billing

00:01:14.430 --> 00:01:16.170
Accounts by expanding
the dropdown

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:18.000
list of Billing Accounts.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.920
Now select the billing account.

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:22.992
Navigate to the
Payment settings page.

00:01:22.992 --> 00:01:24.450
You'll need to be
a billing account

00:01:24.450 --> 00:01:26.880
administrator or viewer
on the billing account

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:28.500
to see this page.

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:33.090
Then, under Payments users,
click Manage payments users.

00:01:33.090 --> 00:01:35.820
Note-- to be able to manage
users and permissions

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.990
for the payments profile,
you must yourself

00:01:37.990 --> 00:01:41.640
have manage users or admin with
all permissions level access

00:01:41.640 --> 00:01:43.500
for the payments profile.

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:45.570
If you need this
access, please reach out

00:01:45.570 --> 00:01:48.570
to the existing
payments profile admins.

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:51.480
Here, you can expand the
details for an existing user

00:01:51.480 --> 00:01:54.840
to update permissions
or to remove the user.

00:01:54.840 --> 00:01:57.510
You can also click
to add a new user.

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:59.130
You can set
permissions for users

00:01:59.130 --> 00:02:01.770
at several levels,
each building on top

00:02:01.770 --> 00:02:03.980
of the prior permissions.

00:02:03.980 --> 00:02:07.400
Read access allows users to
view the payments profile.

00:02:07.400 --> 00:02:10.550
Edit payments profile allows
users to view and edit

00:02:10.550 --> 00:02:12.470
the payments profile.

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:14.390
Sign-up and purchase
allows users

00:02:14.390 --> 00:02:16.970
to link the payments profile
with additional Google

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:18.170
products.

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:20.810
Manage users allows
users to add and update

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:24.140
users and permissions for
those payments profile.

00:02:24.140 --> 00:02:27.320
Admin with all permissions
has all current and future

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:29.690
permissions for the
payments profile.

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:32.090
To set the admin
permission for a user,

00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:34.970
you must be an admin on
this payments profile.

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:37.100
Users with the manage
users permission

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:39.710
can set only up to the
same permissions they are

00:02:39.710 --> 00:02:42.110
granted on their user account.

00:02:42.110 --> 00:02:44.690
When you are finished setting
up permissions for the user,

00:02:44.690 --> 00:02:48.960
click Invite for new users
or Save for existing users.

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:50.180
Congratulations.

00:02:50.180 --> 00:02:53.330
You can now manage permissions
for the payments profile tied

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:54.980
to your Cloud billing account.

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:58.250
Head over to the documentation
to check out more details.

00:02:58.250 --> 00:03:01.600
[MUSIC PLAYING]

